# =============================================================================
# KILL THE KING — Firebase environment TEMPLATE (committed to the repo)
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local dev (`.env.local` is git-ignored).
# Single-player still runs without these; multiplayer shows a "not configured"
# notice until they are present.
#
# For VERCEL deployment: add the SAME NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* keys (below) as
# Environment Variables in the Vercel project (Settings -> Environment). These
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are baked into the client bundle at build time on Vercel.
#
# Create a Firebase project at https://console.firebase.google.com
#  - enable Authentication -> Anonymous sign-in
#  - create a Realtime Database (native mode)
#  - deploy the rules in firebase/database.rules.json (`firebase deploy --only database`)
#  - copy its config into the values below
# =============================================================================

